<title>UK: Bass names Oliver as Holiday Inn chief.</title>
<headline>Bass names Oliver as Holiday Inn chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British brewer-to-leisure group Bass Plc said on Thursday that it was appointing Thomas Oliver chairman, president and chief executive officer of its Holiday Inn Worldwide hotel chain.</p>
</text>
